@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tokenUrl = http://localhost:8081/realms/autoservice/protocol/openid-connect/token

### 1. Отримати JWT адміністратора
POST {{tokenUrl}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=autoservice-api&username=manager&password=manager123

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### 2. Отримати JWT користувача
POST {{tokenUrl}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=autoservice-api&username=client&password=client123

> {% client.global.set("userToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### 3. Без JWT — 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services

### 4. Створення — 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Заміна масла","description":"Заміна моторної оливи","price":500.00,"durationMinutes":45}

> {% client.global.set("serviceId", response.body.id); %}

### 5. Список — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6. Одна послуга — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services/{{serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 7. Оновлення — 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/services/{{serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Заміна масла","description":"Оновлена ціна","price":650.00,"durationMinutes":45}

### 8. SecurityFilterChain: USER — 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 9. SecurityFilterChain: ADMIN — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. PreAuthorize: USER — 403, послуга залишається
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/services/{{serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 11. Валідація — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"","price":-1,"durationMinutes":0}

### 12. Видалення — 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/services/{{serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. Видаленої послуги немає — 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services/{{serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
